          "snippet": {
            "line": 1065,
            "text": "theorem FrameData.norm_le_ambient {Q : Type} (d : FrameData Q) (z : Q × ℝ) (w : State)\n    {H : ℝ} (hne : d.eigenvector z ≠ 0) (hh : |1 / d.eigenvector z| ≤ H) :\n    ‖w‖ ≤ (1 + H) * ‖d.ambient z w‖"
